,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<ul style="list-style-type:none;">',
'    <li>',
'        <strong style="font-size:15px;">1) Agility:  </strong>',
'        <span>Low-code development enables faster application delivery using visual tools and reusable components. It helps organizations respond quickly to new opportunities, reduce development effort, and accelerate digital transformation.</span>',
'    </li><br>',
'    <li>',
'        <strong style="font-size:15px;">2) Cost savings:  </strong>',
'        <span>Low-code development reduces costs by speeding up application delivery and lowering the need for large development teams. It also saves money through workflow automation and helps reduce expenses related to legacy system licensing and m'
||'aintenance.</span>',
'    </li><br>',
'    <li>',
'        <strong style="font-size:15px;">3) Higher Productivity:  </strong>',
'        <span>Low-code development boosts productivity by accelerating application delivery, reducing implementation time and technical debt, and enabling faster innovation. It also leverages AI and automation to enhance efficiency and maximize ROI.<'
||'/span>',
'    </li><br>',
'    <li>',
'        <strong style="font-size:15px;">4) Improved Collaboration:  </strong>',
'        <span>Low-code development improves collaboration by providing shared, organized workspaces where teams can easily build, track, and integrate applications. This fosters faster decision-making, efficient problem-solving, and higher productivi'
||'ty.</span>',
'    </li><br>',
'    <li>',
'        <strong style="font-size:15px;">5) Better Customer Experience:  </strong>',
'        <span>Low-code enables faster responses to customer needs, improving experience, loyalty, and long-term value. It also provides the agility to quickly adapt to changing customer demands.</span>',
'    </li><br>',
'    <li>',
'        <strong style="font-size:15px;">6) Effective Risk Management and Governance:  </strong>',
'        <span>Low-code supports proactive risk management by enabling fast delivery of features that meet evolving regulatory requirements. Enterprise-grade platforms enforce governance, security, and data privacy, reducing production risks and ensur'
||'ing compliance.</span>',
'    </li><br>',
'    <li>',
'        <strong style="font-size:15px;">7) Faster Integration:  </strong>',
'        <span>Enterprise-class low-code platforms enable fast integration of applications, systems, and data, reducing complexity and avoiding silos. Prebuilt templates and no-code connectors allow integrations with databases, cloud services, RPA, AI'
||', and APIs in minutes instead of days.</span>',
'    </li>',
'</ul>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
