,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'The Application Definition is used to manage and configure the core settings of the application. ',
'It helps developers control how the application behaves, appears, and interacts with users.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'Using the Application Definition page, you can:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ul>',
'  <li>Change the application name and basic information.</li>',
'  <li>Configure authentication and security settings.</li>',
'  <li>Manage user interface and theme settings.</li>',
'  <li>Set globalization options such as language and date format.</li>',
'  <li>Configure application-level behavior and properties.</li>',
'</ul>'))
