,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'Database Session settings define how the Oracle APEX application connects and interacts with the database. It controls the schema and PL/SQL code that runs during session start and end.',
'</p>',
'',
'<h4>Why Database Session is Used</h4>',
'',
'<ul>',
'<li>To define which database schema is used by the application.</li>',
'<li>To initialize database session settings.</li>',
'<li>To execute PL/SQL code when a session starts.</li>',
'<li>To clean up session data when the session ends.</li>',
'</ul>',
'',
'',
'',
''))
