wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page_plug(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7663332675813442814)
,p_plug_name=>'Overview'
,p_static_id=>'overview'
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:t-Region--stacked:t-Region--scrollBody:margin-bottom-sm'
,p_plug_template=>4073835273271169698
,p_plug_display_sequence=>10
,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'Search Configuration is created in Shared Components to enable search functionality in the application. ',
'Follow the steps below to create Search Configuration:',
'</p>',
'',
'<ol>',
'<li>Open your Oracle APEX Application.</li>',
'',
'<li>Click on <b>Shared Components</b>.</li>',
'',
'<li>Under <b>Search</b> section, click on <b>Search Configuration</b>.</li>',
'',
'<li>Click on the <b>Create</b> button.</li>',
'',
'<li>Enter the required details:',
'    <ul>',
'        <li><b>Name:</b> Enter the name of the Search Configuration.</li>',
'        <li><b>Search Type:</b> Select the search type as per requirement.</li>',
'        <li><b>Searchable Columns:</b> Select the columns on which search will work.</li>',
'    </ul>',
'</li>',
'',
'<li>Click on the <b>Create</b> button to save the Search Configuration.</li>',
'',
'<li>Now this Search Configuration can be used in Search Region to allow users to search data.</li>',
'',
'</ol>',
''))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page_plug(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7663333063752442818)
,p_plug_name=>'Search Configuration'
,p_static_id=>'search-configuration'
,p_parent_plug_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7663332736373442815)
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:t-Region--stacked:t-Region--scrollBody'
,p_plug_template=>4073835273271169698
,p_plug_display_sequence=>20
,p_plug_new_grid_row=>false
,p_plug_display_point=>'SUB_REGIONS'
,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'Search Configuration with the name <b>Property</b> is used to define and manage search functionality for property-related data in the application.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'The <b>Label (Property)</b> is used to display the name of the search configuration in the application so users can identify the search option.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'The <b>Static ID (property)</b> is used to uniquely identify this search configuration. It helps developers reference and control the search configuration in regions, code, or settings.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'The <b>Search Type (Standard)</b> is used to enable standard search behavior, allowing users to search property-related records based on defined searchable columns.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'This Search Configuration allows users to easily search and access property records within the application.',
'</p>',
'',
''))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page_plug(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7663332736373442815)
,p_plug_name=>'Serch Configuration:Proprty'
,p_static_id=>'serch-configuration-proprty'
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:t-Region--removeHeader js-removeLandmark:t-Region--noBorder:t-Region--scrollBody'
,p_plug_template=>4073835273271169698
,p_plug_display_sequence=>20
,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page_plug(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7663333650724442824)
,p_plug_name=>'Use of Column Mapping Properties'
,p_static_id=>'use-of-column-mapping-properties'
,p_parent_plug_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7663333466078442822)
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:t-Region--stacked:t-Region--scrollBody'
,p_plug_template=>4073835273271169698
,p_plug_display_sequence=>20
,p_plug_new_grid_row=>false
,p_plug_display_point=>'SUB_REGIONS'
,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'<b>Primary Key Column:</b><br>',
'This property is used to uniquely identify each record in the search result. It ensures that every record has a unique identifier.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Primary Key Column 2:</b><br>',
'This property is used to define a second unique column if needed. It is optional and used when two columns together identify a record.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Title Column:</b><br>',
'This property is used to display the main title of the search result. It helps users identify the record easily.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Subtitle Column:</b><br>',
'This property is used to display additional information below the title in the search result.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Description Column:</b><br>',
'This property is used to display detailed information about the record in the search result.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Custom Column 1, Custom Column 2, Custom Column 3:</b><br>',
'These properties are used to display additional custom information in the search result based on application requirements.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Badge Column:</b><br>',
'This property is used to display highlighted information such as status, category, or count in badge format.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Score Column:</b><br>',
'This property is used to display the relevance score of the search result. It shows how closely the record matches the search.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Last Modified Column:</b><br>',
'This property is used to display the date when the record was last updated.',
'</p>',
'',
'<h3 style="text-decoration: underline">Use of Icon and Display</h3>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Icon Source :</b><br>',
'This property is used to display an icon for each search result. When Initials is selected, it shows initials based on the title column.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Default Result Row Template:</b><br>',
'This property is used to define how each search result row will appear and display information to users.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Result CSS Classes:</b><br>',
'This property is used to apply custom CSS styling to the search results.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>No Results Found Message (Nothing found yet.):</b><br>',
'This property is used to display a message when no search results are found.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Maximum Rows to Return:</b><br>',
'This property is used to limit the number of search results displayed.',
'</p>',
'',
''))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page_plug(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7663333365410442821)
,p_plug_name=>'Use of Source Properties in Search Configuration'
,p_static_id=>'use-of-source-properties-in-search-configuration'
,p_parent_plug_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7663333162803442819)
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:t-Region--stacked:t-Region--scrollBody'
,p_plug_template=>4073835273271169698
,p_plug_display_sequence=>10
,p_plug_display_point=>'SUB_REGIONS'
,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'<b>Data Source (Local Database):</b><br>',
'This property is used to define the location of the data. Local Database means the search will be performed on tables available in the current Oracle APEX database schema.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Source Type (Table):</b><br>',
'This property is used to define the type of data source. When Table is selected, the search will be performed directly on the selected database table.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Table / View Owner (Parsing Schema):</b><br>',
'This property is used to define the schema that owns the table or view. It allows APEX to access the correct database object for search.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Table / View Name (PMS_PROPERTY_MASTER):</b><br>',
'This property is used to select the table on which the search will work. All search operations will be performed on this selected table.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Where Clause:</b><br>',
'This property is used to apply conditions to filter the data. Only records matching the specified condition will be included in the search.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Order By Clause:</b><br>',
'This property is used to define the sorting order of the search results. It controls how the search results are displayed.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'<b>Searchable Column(s):</b><br>',
'This property is used to select the columns on which the search will be performed. Users can search data based on these selected columns such as PROPERTY_ID, AREA, PROPERTY_TYPE, CITY, ADDRESS, and LANDMARK.',
'</p>',
'',
'</body>',
'</html>',
''))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
end;
/
