'    <li><b>Images and Logos:</b> Displaying images, icons, and logos specific to the application''s branding or user interface elements.</li>',
'    <li><b>Cascading Style Sheets (CSS):</b> Storing custom CSS files to apply unique styling and control the visual presentation of the application''s pages and components.</li>',
