'',
'  <li><b>Read-Only Reports:</b> Best for showing fixed data like invoices or summaries.</li>',
'',
'  <li><b>Faceted Search:</b> Works with Faceted Search to display filtered results.</li>',
'',
'  <li><b>Custom HTML/PLSQL:</b> Generate dynamic HTML using PL/SQL.</li>',
'',
'  <li><b>Master-Detail Pages:</b> Select a row to update another region on the same page.</li>',
'',
'  <li><b>Custom Buttons:</b> Add Edit, Delete, or Checkbox buttons inside report rows.</li>',
'</ul>'))
