,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>'<p><strong>Avatars</strong> are useful for displaying an icon, image, or initials within a region. An Avatar can be used to display a single (partial) avatar, as multiple (report) avatars, or can be applied as a column type or in report templates to '
