wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page_plug(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(7651569690064375757)
,p_plug_name=>'Central pane of Page Designer'
,p_static_id=>'central-pane-of-page-designer'
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:t-Region--scrollBody'
,p_plug_template=>4073835273271169698
,p_plug_display_sequence=>30
,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<ol>',
'    <li style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Layout Tab</strong></li><br>',
'    <p>The Layout tab visually shows how page components are arranged. You can drag and drop components to move or resize them, use right-click menus to edit or delete items, and add new components from the Gallery. Pane sizes can be adjusted using s'
||'plitters, or expanded and collapsed as needed.</p><br>',
'    <img src="https://g64cf2f956d7752-playground01.adb.us-ashburn-1.oraclecloudapps.com/ords/dev_tavish1/image/get?IMAGE_STATIC_ID=PD_GRID_LAYOUT" alt="P1"><br><br>',
'    <ul>',
'        <p> Key features of the layout tab include:</p>',
'        <li><strong>Context menus: </strong>  Right-click a component or control to display a context menu.</li>',
'        <li><strong>Quick Access to the Property Editor: </strong> Select a component or multiple components to display the corresponding attributes in the Property Editor in the right pane.</li>',
'        <li><strong>Drag and Drop: </strong> Move, copy, and reorder regions, items, and buttons by dragging and dropping. You can also add new regions,items, and button by dragging them from the Gallery and dropping them to the desired position on t'
||'he page.</li>',
'        <li><strong>Tooltips: </strong> Position the mouse over a component or control to view a tooltip of basic information, such as the region type, item type, and so on.</li>',
'    </ul>',
'    <li style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Layout Menu</strong></li><br>',
'    <p>The Layout menu lets you customize what appears in the Layout tab and manage components (delete, move, copy). You can focus on a specific region using Display from Here, or return to the full page view with Display from Page.</p><br>',
'    <img src="https://g64cf2f956d7752-playground01.adb.us-ashburn-1.oraclecloudapps.com/ords/dev_tavish1/image/get?IMAGE_STATIC_ID=PD_GRID_LAYOUT_MENU" alt="P1"><br><br>',
'',
'    <li style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Page Search Tab</strong></li><br>',
'    <p>The Page Search tab lets you quickly search all page components (regions, items, buttons, dynamic actions, columns, etc.). Enter a search term and optionally use Match Case or Regular Expression for advanced searches.</p><br>',
'    <img src="https://g64cf2f956d7752-playground01.adb.us-ashburn-1.oraclecloudapps.com/ords/dev_tavish1/image/get?IMAGE_STATIC_ID=PD_PG_SEARCH" alt="P1"><br><br>',
'',
'    <li style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Help Tab</strong></li><br>',
'    <p>Page Designer provides Help for every Property Editor attribute. Select an attribute and open the Help tab to see its description and available options, which update automatically as you choose different attributes.</p><br>',
'    <img src="https://g64cf2f956d7752-playground01.adb.us-ashburn-1.oraclecloudapps.com/ords/dev_tavish1/image/get?IMAGE_STATIC_ID=PD_HELP" alt="P1"><br><br>',
'',
'    <li style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Gallery</strong></li><br>',
'    <p>The Gallery appears below the Layout tab and includes Regions, Items, and Buttons. You can drag and drop components into the Layout, use tooltips for descriptions, resize or collapse the pane, or right-click components for more options.</p><br'
||'>',
'    <img src="https://g64cf2f956d7752-playground01.adb.us-ashburn-1.oraclecloudapps.com/ords/dev_tavish1/image/get?IMAGE_STATIC_ID=PD_GALLERY" alt="P1"><br><br>',
'</ol>',
''))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
