,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>'<p>Developers can specify minimum latitude, maximum latitude, minimum longitude, and maximum longitude directly in the region attributes. This is useful when the application needs to consistently focus users on a predefined area.</p>'
