,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Multiple Row Selection allows users to select multiple records at the same time within an Interactive Report in Oracle APEX.</p>',
'<p>When enabled, a checkbox is displayed for each row, allowing users to select one or more rows simultaneously. This is useful in scenarios where actions such as bulk updates, deletions, exports, or approvals need to be performed on multiple records'
||'.</p>',
'<p>Users can enhance selection using keyboard interactions:</p>',
'<ul>',
'    <li>Hold the <b>Ctrl (Control)</b> key and click to select multiple individual rows.</li>',
'    <li>Hold the <b>Shift</b> key and click to select a range of rows.</li>',
'</ul>',
'<p>The <b>Current Selection Page Item</b> is used to store the selection state. It holds information about all selected records based on their Primary Key values. The selected values are stored as a single string, separated by colons.</p>',
'<p>This feature enhances usability by enabling efficient handling of multiple records in a single interaction.</p>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
