'<p> Invoke Interactive Report Dialog allows you to programmatically open built-in Interactive Report dialogs using a Dynamic Action in Oracle APEX.</p>',
'',
'<p>This feature introduces a new Dynamic Action called <b>"Invoke Interactive Report Dialog"</b>, which enables developers to directly open dialogs such as Select Columns, Filter, Control Break, or Download without requiring users to navigate through'
||' the default Actions menu.</p>',
'',
'<p>It is particularly useful for creating custom buttons that trigger specific report functionalities, such as opening the Select Columns dialog or directly invoking the Download dialog.</p>',
