,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Oracle APEX 26.1 enhances Map Regions with improved scalability, interactivity, and declarative configuration. New features include map area constraints, data-driven styling, enhanced legends, and JavaScript APIs for runtime layer control. Additio'
||'nally, support for vector tile layers improves performance by loading only the spatial data required for the current view, enabling efficient visualization of large datasets.</p>',
'<p>This release focuses on four areas:',
'    <ul>',
'        <li>Vector tile layer support</li>',
'        <li>Bounding box support</li>',
'        <li>Map styling with substitutions and advanced legend formatting</li>',
'        <li>New JavaScript APIs for layer control</li>',
'    </ul>',
'</p>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
