,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Interactive Report Columns now support CSS Classes, allowing you to directly apply CSS styling to columns without using HTML Expressions.</p>',
'',
'<p>Before this feature, if you wanted to style a column, you usually had to do something like this in an HTML Expression:</p>',
'',
'<p><span class="u-color-2">#STATUS#</span></p>',
'<p>Now, CSS classes can be assigned directly using the <b>CSS Classes</b> attribute of the column.</p>',
'',
'<p>Example:</p>',
'',
'<p>u-color-2</p>',
'<p>Multiple classes can also be applied by separating class names with spaces:</p>',
'',
'<p>u-color-2 u-color-24-text</p>',
'<p>This simplifies styling, improves maintainability, encourages reusable CSS patterns, and removes the need to mix HTML with data rendering.</p>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
