,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>To process uploaded files and save them to your database, you map the <b>File Upload</b> item to a table containing a <b>BLOB</b> column.</p>',
'<ol>',
'    <li><b>Create the Item:</b></li>',
'    <ul>',
'        <li>In your Page Designer, add a new Page Item and set its type to <b>File Upload.</b></li>',
'    </ul>',
'    <li><b>Configure Storage:</b></li>',
'    <ul>',
'        <li>In the item''s properties, under <b>Settings,</b> set <b>Storage Type</b> to <b>BLOB Column.</b></li>',
'        <li>Define the specific table, the BLOB column, and the associated primary key columns.</li>',
'    </ul>',
'    <li><b>Handle Submission:</b></li>',
'    <ul>',
'        <li>Create a <b>Process</b> that executes when the user clicks the Submit button (e.g., executing a DML Process or custom PL/SQL).</li>',
'        <li>This process will automatically insert the uploaded file into the database.</li>',
'    </ul>',
'</ol>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
