,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>You can configure Quick Picks to display dynamically, as a hardcoded static list, or using SQL queries.</p>',
'<ol>',
'    <li>Open your form or page in the <b>Page Designer.</b></li>',
'    <li>Select your page item (e.g., a <b>Select List or Popup LOV).</b></li>',
'    <li>Navigate to the <b>Quick Picks</b> section in your property panel.</b></li>',
'    <li>Set the <b>Type</b> to one of the following:',
'    <ul>',
'        <li><b>Static:</b> Hardcode up to 10 specific labels and values manually.</li>',
