,p_plug_source=>'<p>In Oracle APEX 26.1, <b>Quick Picks allow users to select predefined values with a single click instead of typing or using a dropdown.</b> The 26.1 release upgrades this feature by letting you configure Quick Picks dynamically via List of Values ('
||'LOV), making your UI adaptable and data-driven.</p>'
