,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Undo changes to an interactive grid by clicking the Reset button or by selecting Reset from the Actions, Report submenu.</p>',
'<p>To reset an interactive grid, do one of the following:</p>',
'<ul>',
'    <li>Click the <b>Reset</b> button.</li>',
