'    <p>',
'        A <strong>Page Process</strong> executes logic during page rendering or page submission.',
'    </p>',
'    <p>',
'        It is used to perform tasks such as database operations, PL/SQL execution, or calling the APEX engine.',
'    </p>',
'    <p>',
'        Page processes are created in <strong>Page Designer</strong> under the <strong>Rendering</strong> or <strong>Processing</strong> node by selecting <strong>Create Process</strong>.',
'    </p>',
'</div>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
