'<p>Oracle APEX provides a powerful, declarative, and code-free data loading process that <b>allows users to easily ingest external data into database tables or collections.</b> It supports multiple file formats, including <b>CSV, XLSX, TXT, XML, and '
||'JSON,</b> and streamlines the workflow through file upload, data preview, mapping, and insertion.</p>',
'<h4>Steps</h4>',
'<ol>',
'    <li>Shared Components -> Data Load Definitions</li>',
'    <li>Create Definition -> Target Table</li>',
'    <li>Create Upload Page</li>',
'    <li>Process -> <b>Data Loading</b></li>',
'    <li>Select Data Load Definition.</li>',
'</ol>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
